    {
      "type": "standard",
      "title": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.foods.dairy.milk",
      "summary": "Мод «Травы и урожай» добавляет три новых вида молока.\n\nМолоко используется в рецептах и сыроварении, а при нагревании в котле превращается в сливки.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "literal_text": "Виды молока:\n",
          "text": null
        },
        {
          "type": "icon_list",
          "entries": [
            {
              "item": "herbsandharvest:camel_milk_bucket",
              "text": "guide.herbsandharvest.camel_milk_desc"
            },
            {
              "item": "herbsandharvest:goat_milk_bucket",
              "text": "guide.herbsandharvest.goat_milk_desc"
            },
            {
              "item": "herbsandharvest:sheep_milk_bucket",
              "text": "guide.herbsandharvest.sheep_milk_desc"
